Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.27,0:01:08.92,Note,0,0,0,0,,（1641年 法国）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.74,0:01:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯·麦卡伦 你这只苏格兰猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}James McCullen, you Scottish pig, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.47,0:01:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你因向我们法兰西国王路易十三的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've been found guilty of treason for the sale of military arms{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.08,0:01:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,贩卖军火而被裁定为叛国罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the enemies of our Lord, King Louis XIII, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.38,0:01:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至同时你也在向吾王出售军火\N{\fnArial\fs30}even whilst you sold arms to our Lord himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.92,0:01:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的国王只是个连盟友都杀害的无耻渣滓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your king is a vile bag of filth who murders his own allies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.32,0:01:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应当将他加倍控诉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have charged him double.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.02,0:01:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你企图和吾王的敌人合谋颠覆他的统治\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tried to overthrow the Crown in conspiracy with its enemies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.03,0:01:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你们的蠢蛋国王不同 他的敌人们明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unlike your simpleton king, his enemies know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.37,0:01:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦卡伦的真正使命 并不是简单的兜售军火\N{\fnArial\fs30}that it is the true McCullen destiny not simply to supply arms, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.80,0:01:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是引发战争！\N{\fnArial\fs30}but to run the wars!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.51,0:01:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在刑罚执行之前还有别的话说吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have anything else to say before the sentence is carried out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.34,0:01:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.94,0:01:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,克兰·麦卡伦比你们当中任何人想象的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clan McCullen is far greater and more powerful{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.41,0:01:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,都要伟大和强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}than any of you could ever imagine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.61,0:02:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的子嗣们在我死后将会长久地崛起\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sons will continue to rise long after I am gone, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.65,0:02:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的子孙也会\N{\fnArial\fs30}as will their sons{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.12,0:02:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,如神应允 就会生生不息\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, God willing, their sons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.02,0:02:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的死不会带来终结\N{\fnArial\fs30}It shall not end with my death!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.69,0:02:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们并不打算杀你 麦卡伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not going to kill you, McCullen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.20,0:02:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要给你做个标志！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to make an example of you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.40,0:02:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样就没有人 不论男女老幼 都不再看到你这叛徒的嘴脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that no man, woman nor child may ever see your treacherous face again, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.54,0:02:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的余生都将戴着这个面具度日\N{\fnArial\fs30}you shall wear this mask for the term of your natural life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.58,0:02:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！不！不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No! No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.37,0:02:37.17,Title,0,0,0,0,,《特种部队：眼镜蛇的崛起》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.02,0:02:41.48,Note,0,0,0,0,,（在不远的将来）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.06,0:02:44.86,Note,0,0,0,0,,（北大西洋公约组织武装指挥部）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.86,0:02:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,在近四个世纪以来 我的祖先们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}For nearly four centuries, my ancestors have been{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.46,0:02:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直都是这世上最伟大的武器发明家\N{\fnArial\fs30}the greatest creators of weaponry in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.90,0:02:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但或许在这个世纪 我将超越所有先人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But perhaps in this century, I'll outdo them all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.24,0:02:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳米虫 完美的微型战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nanomites, perfect little soldiers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.81,0:03:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,最初为分割并杀死癌细胞而设计\N{\fnArial\fs30}originally developed to isolate and kill cancer cells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.08,0:03:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在MARS工业\N{\fnArial\fs30}But at MARS Industries, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.51,0:03:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及在北约给予的一些赞助下\N{\fnArial\fs30}and with the help of a little NATO funding, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.05,0:03:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们发现了使它们无所不能的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}we discovered how to program them to do almost anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.39,0:03:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,举个例子 啃蚀金属\N{\fnArial\fs30}For example, eat metal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.76,0:03:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,请看世界上第一枚纳米虫弹头实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch this test of the world's first nanomite warhead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.59,0:03:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一枚这样的弹头 包含七百万个纳米虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each of these warheads contains 7 million nanomites{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.00,0:03:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,拥有着能够侵蚀掉任何东西的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}and has the ability to eat anything from a single tank{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.10,0:03:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论坦克还是一座城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}to an entire city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.47,0:03:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,如同所见 它将迅速地开始啃蚀 它接触到的所有物体和材料\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you can see, it quickly converts to eating any and all material in its path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.81,0:03:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,一经释放 纳米虫将不会停歇 永远不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once unleashed, the nanomites will not stop, ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.95,0:03:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦目标被摧毁…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once the target has been destroyed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.82,0:03:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,使用者可以通过唯一的 与每个弹头配对的开关\N{\fnArial\fs30}the launcher triggers a kill switch unique to each warhead{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.69,0:03:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,来短路掉纳米机器人 以防止不必要的破坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}that short-circuits the nanomites, preventing any unwanted destruction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.09,0:03:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们 我很高兴地宣布 明天早上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, I'm pleased to announce that tomorrow morning, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.29,0:03:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们纳米科技弹头的首批订单 将会从我在吉尔吉斯斯坦的工厂运出\N{\fnArial\fs30}your first order of nanotech warheads ships from my factory in Kyrgyzstan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.65,0:04:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,武器箱正在转移 预计2分钟后交给北约小队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weapons case on the move. ETA two minutes to NATO team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.03,0:04:25.87,Note,0,0,0,0,,（吉尔吉斯斯坦 MARS武器综合车间）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.23,0:04:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 听着 北约老板要的是精英中的精英\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, listen up. NATO wants the best of the best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.70,0:04:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们才在这儿 我们前后都有豹式装甲车护送\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we're here. We got Panthers front and back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.44,0:04:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,犀牛装甲车载着包裹走中间\N{\fnArial\fs30}RHINO's carrying the package in the middle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.87,0:04:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,全程相互保持最小距离 阿帕奇战机将在我们上方护送\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minimum distance at all times. Apaches are covering us from overhead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.44,0:04:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,详述完毕 立正 解散 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detail, attention. Fall out, boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.81,0:04:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,豪瑟上尉 麦卡伦先生要您在这签名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Hauser, Mr. McCullen requires a signature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.18,0:04:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这玩意儿不会炸吧 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not gonna explode, is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.55,0:04:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们还没有被激活 短路器都在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not weaponized yet, and the kill switches are inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.02,0:04:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管如此 我是你的话就会尽量避免颠簸\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the same, I'd avoid potholes if I were you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.75,0:04:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 比尔？- 嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Bill? - Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.29,0:04:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它放在犀牛上 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put that in the RHINO, would you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.76,0:04:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 小妞们！上车！\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, ladies! Mount up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.38,0:05:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 阿帕奇 货已装车 保持警惕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Apaches, we're heavy, so keep your eyes open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.02,0:05:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白 这里到甘奇空军基地的上空畅通无阻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger that. Skies are clear all the way to Ganci.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.39,0:05:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 公爵 我一直在想 - 我之前提醒过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Duke, I've been thinking. - You know, I warned you about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.46,0:05:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想我们该把这转移给谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been thinking about where we should transfer to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.00,0:05:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别说是空军 - 就是空军！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't say the Air Force. - The Air Force!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.73,0:05:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么说的？我以为这个讨论已经结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I say? I thought we were done with this conversation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.07,0:05:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的发言结束了 我还没\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were done with this conversation, not me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.74,0:05:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 我的飞行史…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I've been flying{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.80,0:05:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …从13岁开始 - 13岁开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}- since I was 13 years old. - Thirteen years old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.97,0:05:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得开你爸的农药喷洒机 不能算进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I don't think your dad's crop-duster counts as hours logged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.91,0:05:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的是喷气机 老兄 喷气机！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking jets, man. Jets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.65,0:05:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你知道我每次休假都有资格飞的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know I qualify every time we're on leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.85,0:05:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想到天上去？- 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You want to get up in the air? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.58,0:05:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我给你买个蹦床吧 - 我都填过申请表了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll buy you a trampoline. - I filled out the application.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.16,0:05:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？他们接受了那些蜡笔鬼画符？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? They accept those in crayon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.79,0:06:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 老兄 给我一个不飞的好理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, dude. Give me one good reason why not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.63,0:06:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我想在战场里面 在战斗中 而不是飞在上空\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I want to be on the ground, in the fight, not flying over it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.17,0:06:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,先锋1 这里是先锋2 启动夜视模式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pioneer 1, this is Pioneer 2, going night vision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.98,0:06:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明白 - 执行并后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Roger that. - Go ahead and back off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.98,0:06:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,腾出点安全距离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me some separation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.88,0:06:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,先锋1 这里是先锋2 已启动夜视模式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pioneer 1, this is Pioneer 2. Going NVS.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.35,0:06:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.25,0:06:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 公爵 我们不是定好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Duke, weren't we supposed to meet up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.96,0:06:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,和侦查小队在40公里处会合的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the recon team at 40 klicks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.82,0:06:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 怎么了？- 呃 我们刚经过了第41公里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. So? - Well, we just passed kilometer 41.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.56,0:06:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小心 小心！- 周围什么都没有 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eyes out, eyes out! - Sweep's still clear, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.57,0:06:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 这里除了我们没别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger that. There's nothing up here but us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.98,0:06:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆 发射曳光弹并开始自行搜索…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom, put a self-test on the flare and start to scan for…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.95,0:06:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.65,0:06:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那该死的是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.92,0:07:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,先锋1 你中弹了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pioneer 1, you've been hit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.03,0:07:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.00,0:07:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大鸟坠毁！大鸟坠毁！- 后退！后退！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bird down! Bird down! - Back up! Back up! Back up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.07,0:07:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,各单位 我们遭到袭击！他们是抢弹头的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}All units, we are under attack! They're after the warheads!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.57,0:07:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,先锋2 交火！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pioneer 2, engage!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.70,0:07:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把那混蛋给我打下来！- 收到！给点颜色这家伙看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Put that asshole on the ground! - Roger that. Put some hurt on this guy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.64,0:07:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,机载机枪 正在开火 正在开火！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tommy guns. Firing, firing, firing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.95,0:07:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 导弹待发 - 锁定发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Missiles armed. - Match and shoot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.32,0:07:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁定发射！导弹发射！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Match and shoot! Missiles off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.02,0:07:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在空中把导弹打掉了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}They shot them right out of the air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.13,0:07:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦我的上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.44,0:07:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 先锋2坠毁！我们失去制空权！- 我们被合围了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pioneer 2 is down! We've lost our air! - They're boxing us in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.64,0:07:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,各单位 散开！我重复 各单位 散开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}All units, fan out! I repeat, all units, fan out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.55,0:08:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,地对空导弹瞄准这家伙！发射！发射！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want SAMs on that thing! Light him up! Light him up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.43,0:08:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,它掉头回来了 50毫米炮瞄准它！\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's coming around. Get those.50s on him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.84,0:08:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,打过来啦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incoming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.71,0:08:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓稳！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.48,0:08:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.88,0:08:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 但我的脚卡住了 那玩意儿是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but my leg is pinned. What the hell was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.80,0:09:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快 我们要加入战斗 - 小心 我的脚！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, we gotta get in this fight. - Careful, my leg!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.54,0:09:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 伙计 我们上 起来 快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, buddy, let's go. Let's go, get up, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.54,0:09:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,公爵 我们要先拿到那些弹头！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duke, you gotta go get those warheads!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.51,0:09:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴！我要先带你离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up! I gotta get you out of here first!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.92,0:09:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,向空旷地带开火！右翼！右翼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire at the opening! Right side, right side!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.12,0:09:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来 起来 起来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up, get up, get up, get up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.83,0:09:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该死的腿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}My damn leg!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.93,0:10:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你呆在这儿 明白？- 你要去哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You wait here, okay? - Where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.43,0:10:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去拿那箱子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta go get that case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.47,0:10:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,空军 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Air Force, right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.08,0:10:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.75,0:10:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好啊公爵 - 安娜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello, Duke. - Ana?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.19,0:10:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你必须承认 这是你自找的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you have to admit, you had that coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.50,0:10:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ana!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.41,0:10:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ana!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.04,0:10:56.06,Note,0,0,0,0,,（已记录目标）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.20,0:11:05.41,Note,0,0,0,0,,（回卷中）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.57,0:11:07.59,Note,0,0,0,0,,（目标锁定）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.27,0:11:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye-bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.28,0:11:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜！安娜！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ana! Ana!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.20,0:11:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,别逼我对女人开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make me shoot a woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.70,0:11:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,炮火来袭！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incoming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.13,0:12:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,后退 都给我后退！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand down. Stand the hell down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.53,0:12:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放下武器 先生 - 我们不是敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Put the weapon down, sir. - We're not the enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.86,0:12:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,用武器对准我是不能和我交朋友的 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pointing your weapons at me doesn't make you my friend, now, does it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.20,0:12:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,请把箱子交出来 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please hand over the case, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.37,0:12:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认识你 而且我也很肯定不认识那帮人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know you, and I sure as hell don't know who they are, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.94,0:12:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非我搞清楚 否则我不会放下任何东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}and until I find out, I'm not lowering anything{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.87,0:12:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不会交出任何东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I ain't handing anything over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.21,0:12:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是我们出手 你的下场就和你其他的手下一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it weren't for us, you'd be out there with the rest of your boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.94,0:12:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以请交出那箱子 - 你是哪个队伍的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So hand over the case. - What's your unit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.65,0:12:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是机密\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's classified.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.85,0:12:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人想和你谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone would like to have a word with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.65,0:12:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,报上你的姓名和军阶\N{\fnArial\fs30}State your name and rank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.99,0:12:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你先说 - 我的部下刚刚救了你的命 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You first. - My team just saved your life, son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.49,0:12:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在该到你说谢谢的时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the part where you get to say thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.76,0:12:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这两个字不是我现在想说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those aren't the words that come to mind right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.23,0:12:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没收到任何消息说这次行动会有支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't told anything about any support for this mission, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.56,0:12:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以为什么不让你的手下先退下呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}so why don't you tell your team to stand down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.10,0:12:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我看来你们就像大大的活靶子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could turn this into one big turkey shoot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.83,0:12:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.30,0:12:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,或别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.87,0:12:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松 开伞索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, Ripcord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.64,0:12:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么认识我的？- 杰出枪手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do you know me? - Expert marksman, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.41,0:13:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们营排名第二 武器专家 持有喷气机驾照\N{\fnArial\fs30}second in your battalion. Weapons specialist, jet qualified.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.78,0:13:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我和你说过 - 现在别闹 开伞索\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I told you. - Not now, Rip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.31,0:13:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是克莱顿·阿博纳西将军 你可能听说过我 公爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is General Clayton Abernathy. Perhaps you've heard of me, Duke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.92,0:13:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍克将军 阿富汗 北约前线指挥官\N{\fnArial\fs30}General Hawk. Afghanistan, NATO forward command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.89,0:13:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 那是我上一份工作 我现在穿上不同的军装了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that was my last job. I'm in a whole new outfit now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.39,0:13:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 只是为了安全起见 我要关掉里面的追踪信号器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I just need to deactivate the tracking beacon for security.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.43,0:13:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,把武器箱放下 小子 让我们来送这些弹头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put down that weapons case, son, and let us deliver those warheads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.23,0:13:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没门 我接受了这个任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way. I signed for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.07,0:13:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的使命 我的包裹 我接手了 我就送达\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my mission, my package. I carry them, I deliver them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.74,0:13:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 那好吧 不过你现在看起来好像缺少交通工具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's just fine, but you seem to be a little short of transportation right now, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.27,0:13:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我的A小队会把你送来我这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}so my Team Alpha will deliver you to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.58,0:13:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你确切的位置在哪儿 长官？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where exactly are you, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.51,0:13:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己来看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come see for yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.00,0:13:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你们特别行动组的人都是猛男\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought all you Special Ops guys were tough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.83,0:13:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是猛男 不过我们也很敏感体贴\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are tough. But we're also sensitive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.80,0:13:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来就好 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it. Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.17,0:14:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 这些东西真先进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, this is some primo stuff here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.14,0:14:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 老兄 你这些头发可真逼真\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, bro, you got some real lifelike hair over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.91,0:14:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,还会擒拿手\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a kung fu grip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.54,0:14:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 躺下 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lie down. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.35,0:14:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说来 这些都是什么制服？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of outfit is this, anyway?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.91,0:14:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不是普通部队的 听你们口音就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not regular Army, based on all the accents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.75,0:14:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是英国腔 你的呢 北非法语？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're British. What are you, French North African?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.92,0:14:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩洛哥 你出生在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morocco. Where were you born?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.55,0:14:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,公爵不是生出来的 他是政府发行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duke wasn't born. He was government-issued.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.32,0:14:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那你呢？- 他不说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about you? - He doesn't speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.79,0:14:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么？- 他不说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - He doesn't say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.33,0:14:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不说话 那不管怎样你们都是一个部队的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't say. So, somehow you're all in the same unit, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.93,0:14:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个不能告诉我名字的部队 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}but one you can't tell me the name of, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.87,0:14:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,说了我们会被驱逐\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd get tossed for telling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.23,0:14:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不会放过那些袭击我们的人吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna go after those guys that hit my convoy, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.07,0:14:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 不管你们是谁 你们属于哪个部队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, whoever you are and whatever this unit is, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.01,0:14:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.61,0:15:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}General.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.05,0:15:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还好吗 姑娘？- 干得好 特种兵们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's up, girl? - Good job, Joes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.55,0:15:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常出色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outstanding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.22,0:15:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到地下基地 公爵 你们俩我久仰大名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the Pit, Duke. I've read a lot about you two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.65,0:15:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该相信你听说的东西 听着 实际上我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you can't believe everything you read. See, I actually…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.92,0:15:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白 几年前我曾试图招募你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand we even tried to recruit you a few years back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.83,0:15:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我从没收到加入任何行动组的邀请 - 真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I never got asked to join any Op group. - Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.30,0:15:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不记得4年前在泰国的事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't remember Thailand about four years ago?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.76,0:15:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在你砸了那家酒吧之前？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right before you broke up that bar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.93,0:15:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概4年前 我的伙计有点私事\N{\fnArial\fs30}About four years ago, my boy had issues.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.64,0:15:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 他的私事出了点事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, his issues had issues.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.84,0:15:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一辈子都在军队里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been in the military my entire life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.94,0:15:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我从没见过这样的作战行动组\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I have never seen a tac operation like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.44,0:15:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你相信了我 我想我也该相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you trusted me, I guess I'll trust you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.41,0:15:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,严格地说 特种部队并不存在 如果存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Technically, G.I. Joe does not exist, but if it did, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.65,0:15:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就是由世上最顶尖的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}it'd be comprised of the top men and women{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.92,0:15:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,军事部队里的精英男女所组成的 王牌部队！\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the best military units in the world, the alpha dogs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.76,0:16:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,当所有人都失败时 我们不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}When all else fails, we don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.56,0:16:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,最初有10个国家加入我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten nations signed on in our first year, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.13,0:16:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起行动 分享情报 迄今为止已有23个成员国\N{\fnArial\fs30}working together, sharing intel. Now we have 23.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.53,0:16:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是什么？- 电子迷彩服\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's that? - Camouflage suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.44,0:16:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能把你身后的景物投影到身前\N{\fnArial\fs30}It photographs everything behind you and puts it in front of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.61,0:16:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麦卡伦先生已经准备好了 长官 - 用全息投影通话把他接进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. McCullen is standing by, sir. - Patch him through via TelePresence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.78,0:16:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那么谁打了我们？- 暂时未知\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So who hit us? - Currently unknown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.58,0:16:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有一点是肯定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But one thing's for sure, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.91,0:16:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她能得到最高机密的情报和最新式的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}she's got highly classified intel and state-of-the-art weaponry, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.58,0:16:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,说明她背后有着庞大的资金支柱\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means there's a whole hell of a lot of money behind her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.52,0:16:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们拥有我们之前从未遇到过的实力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their capabilities are beyond anything we've ever encountered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.19,0:16:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 那就是我们被当场打得屁滚尿流的 唯一理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's the one and only reason why we got our asses kicked out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.26,0:16:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须尽可能找到有关她的一切情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to find out everything we can about her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.66,0:16:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,知彼知己是作战的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knowing is half the battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.60,0:16:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们 这是麦卡伦先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, Mr. McCullen, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.23,0:16:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,MARS工业集团的首席执行官 也是这些弹头的制造者\N{\fnArial\fs30}CEO of MARS Industries and the builder of these warheads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.67,0:16:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军 看起来我当初应该选择你 来执行这次任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}General, clearly you were the security option I should have chosen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.54,0:16:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的什么话？我的队员为了这次任务都拼了命\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you just say? My team did everything we could out there, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.41,0:16:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很多好士兵都送了命 - 对 但你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and a lot of good men went down. - Yeah, but not you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.38,0:17:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次行动是绝密的 所以很明显有人出卖了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}That mission was classified, so clearly someone sold us out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.12,0:17:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用了10年时间和130亿欧元 来造这4枚弹头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spent 10 years and 13 billion euros creating these four warheads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.09,0:17:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你的工作 上尉 就是保护它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your job, Captain, was to protect them, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.86,0:17:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是多亏了霍克将军 你早就失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if it wasn't for General Hawk, you'd have failed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.59,0:17:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的评价并不公平 他完全执行了收到的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not a fair assessment. He followed his orders to the letter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.86,0:17:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 但那并不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that wasn't enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.83,0:17:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 为了不让袭击你们的混蛋找到你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, so the bastards who attacked you can't find you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.90,0:17:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你须要把藏在箱子里的追踪信号器关掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}you need to disable the tracking beacon hidden in the case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.54,0:17:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们已经关了 - 好样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We already have. - Good man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.54,0:17:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过还是让我检查一下有没有什么损坏吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But allow me to check them to see if any have been damaged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.15,0:17:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,请把它打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open it, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.86,0:17:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的探测器显示它们完好无损 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}My scan says they're intact, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.42,0:17:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 密码是什么？- 「529440」\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's the code? - 5-2-9-4-4-0.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.08,0:18:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,[法语] 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.58,0:18:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,请时刻让我知道你们的进展 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please keep me informed of your progress, General.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.99,0:18:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,断路器？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breaker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.63,0:18:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的声音分析器显示他上下左右摇摆不定\N{\fnArial\fs30}My voice analyzer on that guy was going up, down and sideways.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.53,0:18:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来麦卡伦先生正在忙一些 不想让我们知道的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like McCullen's working an angle he don't want us to catch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.23,0:18:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,快没时间了 我们现在就需要那些弹头！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on a deadline. We need those warheads now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.40,0:18:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也知道的 用了10年来策划这件事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew that! Ten years setting this up, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.51,0:18:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,从北约那里榨取投资 现在这一步应该是最简单的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}wringing money out of NATO, this was supposed to be the easy part.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.51,0:18:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你当初让我在你宝贝工厂 发动进攻的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you had let me stage the assault at your precious factory, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.48,0:18:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就能完全掌控局势\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have contained the situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.75,0:18:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后立刻就让客户失去对我们的信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}And lost the trust of our clients in the process.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.39,0:18:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须要让北约负这个责任！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It had to be NATO's fault!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.56,0:18:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.26,0:18:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看到他的时候犹豫了？- 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you hesitate when you saw him? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.23,0:18:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这和他一点关系没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}This had nothing to do with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.87,0:18:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,原谅我的嫉妒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive my jealousy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.81,0:19:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你追踪到那个箱子没？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you tracked the case?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.78,0:19:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们当然关闭了导向信号器\N{\fnArial\fs30}They, of course, deactivated the homing beacon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.11,0:19:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给了他们一个神不知鬼不觉的激活密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave them a code to quietly reactivate it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.28,0:19:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,地点在埃及 地下基地 只是有传言说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in Egypt. The Pit, only mentioned in whispers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.86,0:19:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把弹头取回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will get those warheads back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.39,0:19:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.93,0:19:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我在你旁边 或许我会允许你碰我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I were really there, I might actually let you touch me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.27,0:19:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可以派飞机接你 - 先办公事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll send a jet. - Business first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.37,0:19:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,况且 我是有夫之妇 记得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, I'm married, remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.11,0:19:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你当初派我去 可能早就完工了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you had sent me in the first place, it would already be done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.41,0:19:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就派你去 白幽灵 别再失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sending you now, Storm Shadow. No more mistakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.82,0:19:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划不能再受到影响了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The schedule mustn't be compromised any further.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.89,0:19:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我把她看好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your eye on her for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.02,0:19:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国政治州长参议院国会议员\N{\fnArial\fs30}American politics, governors, senators, congressmen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.53,0:20:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,难怪什么事也办不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No wonder nothing ever gets done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.36,0:20:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是我们要解决的 扎坦先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what we're going to fix, Mr. Zartan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.93,0:20:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼镜王蛇 高贵的生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king cobra, magnificent creature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.60,0:20:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,大自然的死神 以及致命企图的象征\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nature's Grim Reaper and symbol of lethal purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.03,0:20:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不出击则无法明视\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unseen until it strikes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.90,0:20:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要一口 它的毒液就能把一只成年大象毒死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its venom can kill a full-grown elephant with a single bite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.07,0:20:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 非常好 - 迄今为止我们制造了20个尼奥蛇魔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Very nice. - So far we've created 20 Neo-Vipers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.38,0:20:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 其中19个站在你面前 - 有效吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nineteen stand before you. - Is it working?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.28,0:20:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们给每个实验对象都注射了1000毫升的 纳米虫溶液\N{\fnArial\fs30}We injected 1, 000 cc of the nanomite solution into each subject.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.52,0:20:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们最终停止尖叫后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they finally stopped screaming, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.32,0:21:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,扫描显示它们大脑皮层的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}brain scans showed a complete inactivity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.42,0:21:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,自我保护区域完全停止了活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the self-preservation region of the cortex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.66,0:21:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,讲英语吗 博士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}English, Doctor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.36,0:21:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们感觉不到恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}They feel no fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.30,0:21:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,大脑皮层的神经簇群完全处于静止状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cortical nerve clusters show complete inactivity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.87,0:21:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们感觉不到疼痛 道德观念已经被抛离\N{\fnArial\fs30}They feel no pain. Concepts of morality are disengaged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.05,0:21:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们感觉不到后悔 感觉不到怜悯\N{\fnArial\fs30}They feel no regrets, no remorse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.32,0:21:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳米虫如同战斗机器般集结起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The nanomites join together as a fighting mechanism, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.02,0:21:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先阻断 然后排出眼镜蛇的毒液\N{\fnArial\fs30}first blocking, then expelling the cobra's venom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.20,0:21:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们完全服从命令吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they're completely obedient?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.44,0:21:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.14,0:21:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,现实世界的应用将是无止尽的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The real-world applications are endless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.61,0:21:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你来告诉我 这好用吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you tell me, is it working?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.51,0:22:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,派一个小队去会合白幽灵与男爵夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send a team to rendezvous with Storm Shadow and the Baroness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.58,0:22:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果成功了 特种兵们都不知道是谁袭击了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consider it done. The Joes will never know what hit them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.29,0:22:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,第20个尼奥蛇魔已经在华盛顿特区安插好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The 20th Neo-Viper is already set up in Washington, DC{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.49,0:22:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,在等待你的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}and awaiting your signal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.80,0:22:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干的不错 你的研究终于派上用场了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've done well. You've thrown the caber clear out of the yard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.13,0:22:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统地堡的工程也已经竣工了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Construction of the presidential bunker has also been completed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.14,0:22:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 如果我们卖一枚弹头到黑市\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if we sold one warhead on the black market, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.70,0:22:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能继续我的研究了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could continue my research.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.07,0:22:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感激你对科技的渴求 博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I appreciate your thirst for knowledge, Doctor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.17,0:22:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这个世界已经够乱的了 不卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this world is messy enough. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.48,0:22:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,它需要的是一个唯一的统领\N{\fnArial\fs30}What it needs is unification, leadership.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.25,0:22:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,要有一个完全掌控的人 把它从混沌中解救出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has to be taken out of chaos by someone with complete control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.49,0:22:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,北京莫斯科华盛顿…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beijing, Moscow, Washington…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.66,0:22:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,当这些导弹被引爆\N{\fnArial\fs30}When these missiles detonate, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.43,0:22:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,全世界都会向这世上最强大的人求救\N{\fnArial\fs30}the world will turn to the most powerful man on the planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.07,0:22:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我成功之后 钞票会滚滚而来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I'm finished, the money will take care of itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.47,0:22:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就可以作任何你想作的研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be able to do all the research you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.78,0:23:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从一个作战摄像头上捕捉到了这个影像\N{\fnArial\fs30}We grabbed this image from one of our tactical cameras.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.88,0:23:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们对她的脸作一个全匹配扫描\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we're running her face through an infinity scan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.99,0:23:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 这不是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, isn't that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.06,0:23:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经得到全世界 各个地方各个服务器上的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have access to any photograph on any server, anywhere in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.23,0:23:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 每个人总会在某个地方某个时间 留下相片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. Everyone gets photographed in some way at some time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.50,0:23:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,足球比赛自动提款机机场…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Football game, ATM machine, airport…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.76,0:23:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会找到她的 然后就知道是谁派她来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find her, and then we'll find out who sent her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.00,0:23:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 北约来电 长官 - 你还好吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- From NATO, sir. - Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.27,0:23:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她到底怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.54,0:23:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 看起来我已经被任命为 这些弹头的看管者了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it appears that I've been made official custodian of the warheads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.41,0:23:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的任务应该就此结束了 公爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like your mission is complete here, Duke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.55,0:23:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你们转移它们时 她会找上门来的 你知道的吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you move them, she's gonna come after you. You know that, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.25,0:23:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,凭着她的情报和手下 她会找到你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And with her intel and toys, she'll find you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.02,0:23:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意思是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your point?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.09,0:23:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要先发制人的话就让我们加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going after her first and we want in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.92,0:23:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军 当场被灭的是我们小队 我们要报仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}General, it was our team that got wasted out there. We deserve payback.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.06,0:23:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,特种部队不接受入队申请 只有被邀请\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't ask to be part of G.I. Joe. You get asked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.96,0:23:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,4年前你考察过我 现在我准备好了 让我们开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You scouted me four years ago. Now I'm ready. Let's have at it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.33,0:24:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我也损失了人手 上尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I've lost men, too, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.24,0:24:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果你想报仇… - 我认识她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lf you want revenge… - I know her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.97,0:24:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.07,0:24:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过知彼知己是作战的一部分 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said knowing's half the battle, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.81,0:24:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好 我知道她是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I know who she is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.21,0:24:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,她以前金发的 名字是安娜·刘易斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was a blonde. Her name is Ana Lewis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.95,0:24:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以告诉你她的一切事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could tell you everything you need to know about her, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.42,0:24:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到4年前\N{\fnArial\fs30}up until the last four years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.22,0:24:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那之后很显然 很多事情变化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}After that, obviously, a lot of things have changed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.71,0:24:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妻子终于到家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally, my wife is home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.81,0:24:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊丹尼尔 你和国防部长的会议怎样了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Daniel. How was your meeting with the Minister of Defense?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.82,0:24:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他十分激动 加速器表现得完美无瑕\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was thrilled. The accelerator performed flawlessly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.22,0:24:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真希望你当时也在场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish you would have been there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.66,0:24:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你的实验室小家伙们真是聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and your little lab rats are so clever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.02,0:24:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 蒙特卡洛好玩吗？- 我没有得到我追寻的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How was Monte Carlo? - I didn't get what I was after.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.76,0:25:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我应当为此感到欣慰 - 大多数丈夫都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I suppose I should be grateful. - Most husbands would be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.56,0:25:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,大多数丈夫没有这么神秘的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most husbands don't have such mysterious wives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.53,0:25:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们清楚知道她们在哪儿 她们在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}They know exactly where they are and what they do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.87,0:25:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们以为知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}They think they know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.24,0:25:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜 我不想斗嘴 我想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ana, I don't wanna fight. I missed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.51,0:25:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我从来不厌倦斗嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I never tire of a good fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.74,0:25:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不是和你 亲爱的 让我梳洗一下再到楼下找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not with you, darling. Let me freshen up and I'll meet you downstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.81,0:25:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是爱你的 我美丽的男爵夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do love you, my beautiful Baroness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.06,0:25:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦卡伦给我命令 如果男爵再这么碰你我就会杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}McCullen gave me orders to kill the Baron if he so much as touched you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.39,0:25:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我丈夫 他当然会碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's my husband. Of course he touches me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.33,0:25:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说 他实验室的工作 在我们有所触碰之后会进行得更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}And besides, his work at the lab goes much better after we've touched.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.83,0:25:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,而那是件要紧的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's the important thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.40,0:25:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你在干什么？监视我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what are you doing? Spying on me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.67,0:25:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我要监视你 你永远不会察觉到\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I was spying on you, you would never know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.78,0:25:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有进步了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting closer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.98,0:25:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾是我最好的学生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were my best student.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.79,0:26:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会和你一起去取回弹头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be coming with you to retrieve the warheads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.59,0:26:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们天亮出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go at dawn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.44,0:26:16.89,Note,0,0,0,0,,（4年前）
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.58,0:26:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Ana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.59,0:26:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我一直想在部队集结前做这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so, I've been wanting to do this before we deploy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.66,0:26:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,公爵 太漂亮了 真是太漂亮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duke, it's beautiful. It's too beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.13,0:26:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然我一生只须要买一个戒指 为什么不呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm only going to buy one of these, so why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.77,0:26:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.37,0:26:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,说愿意啊傻瓜 这可是活生生的美国英雄啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say yes, you idiot. He's a real American hero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.28,0:26:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢毁了这气氛 雷克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for ruining the mood, Rex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.48,0:26:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我道歉 我是来接你回岗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I apologize. I just came to offer you a ride back to post.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.91,0:27:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？到时间了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? It's time already?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.75,0:27:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊我们要在5点整动身 - 这是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, we got to go at 0500. - Is it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.35,0:27:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊没错 对吗？这就是你把雷克斯从实验室带出来的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it is, right? That's why you're pulling Rex out of the lab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.09,0:27:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安娜 听我说 很抱歉 但我不能… - 对 对 机密 最高机密\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ana, look, I'm sorry, but I can't… - Yeah, yeah, classified, top secret, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.49,0:27:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果和我说了就要杀我灭口 废话连篇\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd have to kill me if you told me, blah-blah-blah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.16,0:27:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到机密信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}And speaking of classified information, you still haven't answered me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.20,0:27:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还没有给我答复\N{\fnArial\fs30}And speaking of classified information, you still haven't answered me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.47,0:27:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意 我当然愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Yes. Of course it's yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.27,0:27:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有一个条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}On one condition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.57,0:27:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须向我保证 你不会让我的天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to promise me that you will not let my genius, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.08,0:27:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,书呆子弟弟受一点伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}egghead brother get hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.71,0:27:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我仅有的家人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the only family I've got left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.15,0:27:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,向我保证 公爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise me, Duke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.15,0:27:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.12,0:27:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 我最喜欢三个家伙 - 威姆斯先生 还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey! My three favorite people. - Mr. Weems. Good, man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.66,0:27:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不错 - 看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.99,0:27:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 石头不错 真是份厚爱啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Nice rock. That's a lot of love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.57,0:27:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在求婚？- 其实我求完婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you proposing? - I'm actually done proposing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.47,0:27:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也说过愿意了 - 我的天 恭喜你们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I already said yes. - Oh, my God! Congratulations!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.00,0:27:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,漂亮极了！你们俩就像婚礼蛋糕上那对白色小人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful! You guys are like the little white couple on the wedding cake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.88,0:28:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,太可爱了 给我些爱吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}How cute. Give me some love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.05,0:28:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你们 等等 这不是正式的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations. Wait. It's not official.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.38,0:28:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？- 不是正式的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - It's not official.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.42,0:28:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 除非你回答了我的问题 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not until you answer my question. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.22,0:28:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱不爱我的兄弟？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you love my boy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.79,0:28:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直爱 永远爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always and forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.23,0:28:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可能用了威胁的手段来加入这个队伍\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may have blackmailed your way onto this team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.03,0:28:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不意味我会喜欢这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't mean I've got to like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.47,0:28:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但的确意味着 我必须让你们准备好接受任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it does mean I've gotta get you mission ready, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.71,0:28:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,特种兵的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joe style.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.98,0:28:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你们面前的 是德耳塔-6型加速套装\N{\fnArial\fs30}Standing in front of you are Delta-6 Accelerator suits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.91,0:28:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它给什么加速？- 你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What does it accelerate? - You.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.91,0:28:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会让你跑得更快 跳得更高 让你比任何敌人都更有力\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll make you run faster, jump higher and hit harder than any of your enemies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.39,0:28:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始着装\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's suit up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.82,0:28:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是从头到脚的水力学 和高度气密下的气体力学装备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Head-to-toe hydraulics and highly pressurized pneumatics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.29,0:28:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个加强的智能控制显示头盔\N{\fnArial\fs30}An advanced cybernetics heads-up display helmet, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.33,0:28:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,它与套装相连接\N{\fnArial\fs30}which feeds into the suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.17,0:28:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有所想 它有所动\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think it, it does it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.77,0:29:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,双制气推式钩枪…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twin gas-propelled grappling spears{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.67,0:29:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,和三倍爆炸力热导式射后不理式导弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}and triple-explosive, heat-seeking, fire-and-forget rockets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.84,0:29:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我的个人最爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my personal favorite, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.58,0:29:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,一把10毫米无弹壳格林机关枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}a 10-millimeter caseless Gatling submachine gun, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.51,0:29:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,每分钟能够发射50发子弹 全自备式火力\N{\fnArial\fs30}capable of firing 50 rounds per second. Fully self-contained firepower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.85,0:29:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,十分适合像你们这样的菜鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect for a couple of cowboys like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.35,0:29:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚说的我都错过了 嘿 我帅吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just missed everything you said. Hey, how do I look?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.16,0:29:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 挺酷的吧？- 有问题吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pretty cool, huh? - Any questions?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.94,0:29:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊巨石中士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, Sergeant Stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.21,0:29:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们是特种兵吗？- 才不是 他们是特种饼…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are they Joes? - Hell, no. They're jokes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.48,0:29:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.42,0:29:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会用上这个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna need these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.22,0:29:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是想对你说 当我确定目标的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just so you know, when I get a target in my sights, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.96,0:29:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就会拿下它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take it down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.30,0:30:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.37,0:30:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再来 - 再来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Again. - Again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.38,0:30:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是想对你说 有些目标要相对的难以击中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just so you know, some targets are harder to hit than others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.76,0:30:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再来 - 你最好戴上那头盔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Again. - You're gonna need that helmet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.81,0:30:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,退下吧 面具人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand down, Snake Eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.61,0:30:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 走吧 散场了 以后还有得看\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Walk away. It's over. This ain't pay-per-view.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.52,0:30:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真是太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm nasty with it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.98,0:30:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个脱了靶\N{\fnArial\fs30}You missed one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.12,0:30:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 我肯定创下了记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. That gotta be some kind of a record or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.12,0:31:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 记录是20个全中 - 谁创造的？让我猜猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The record is all 20 killed. - Who did that? Let me guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.86,0:31:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 面具人？- 不 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Snake Eyes? - No. Me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.49,0:31:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你要向目标开火 就得彻底 否则 就要肉搏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're gonna shoot at something, kill it. Otherwise, take up knitting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.13,0:31:11.11,Note,0,0,0,0,,（第99百分位）
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.24,0:31:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,初学者的运气 保持专注\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beginner's luck. Stay focused.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.45,0:31:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再来 - 再来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Again. - Again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.62,0:31:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没见到面具人被打中过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have never seen Snake Eyes take a hit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.52,0:31:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是特种兵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're Joes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.53,0:31:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.20,0:31:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.07,0:31:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 老兄 断路器告诉我红发女郎12岁就大学毕业了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man, Breaker told me that Scarlett graduated college at 12 years old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.51,0:31:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就像个难以捉摸的致命小天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's like some freaky little deadly genius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.78,0:31:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开伞索 知道了 你喜欢她 - 抱歉 怪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rip. I get it, Rip. You like her. - Sorry, my bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.45,0:32:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 管它的 - 开伞索\N{\fnArial\fs30}- To hell with it. - Rip. Rip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.98,0:32:06.09,Note,0,0,0,0,,（构造原理）
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.62,0:32:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,「六百骑兵全部进入了死亡之谷」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Into the valley of death rode the 600.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.22,0:32:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你在干嘛呢？海边阅读吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what are you doing? A little beach reading?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.60,0:32:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.70,0:32:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 我想我们之间一开始就有些误会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I think you and me got off on the wrong foot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.94,0:32:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 我被你吸引住了 而你 也被我吸引住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I'm attracted to you. And you, you're attracted to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.01,0:32:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 那个大禅师\N{\fnArial\fs30}And him, the damn Zen master, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.71,0:32:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他让我直起疙瘩 我想说的意思是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}he creeps me out. What I'm trying to say is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.65,0:32:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们彼此被对方吸引 - 谢谢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're attracted to each other. - Thank you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.21,0:32:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的意思 不是我的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you're saying. It's not what I'm saying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.55,0:32:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.85,0:32:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那 你要说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are you saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.59,0:32:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,被吸引是一种情感 情感无法用科学解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attraction is an emotion. Emotions are not based in science.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.23,0:32:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不能量化那样事物 或证明它的存在 那么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you can't quantify or prove that something exists, well, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.13,0:32:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我看来 它就是不存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}in my mind, it doesn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.70,0:32:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我回头再和你讨论这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I'll get back to you on that one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.47,0:32:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,立正！将军到！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attention! General on deck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.04,0:33:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍息 公爵…\N{\fnArial\fs30}At ease. Duke, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.54,0:33:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的成绩在我们考核过的所有人当中 名列前茅\N{\fnArial\fs30}you scored in the top half percent of all people we've ever tested.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.68,0:33:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,开伞索 如果用你和公爵的分数 合起来对半分 你也合格了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rip, if we average your scores with Duke's, you pass, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.85,0:33:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 欢迎加入我们 - 谢谢 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Welcome aboard. - Thank you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.35,0:33:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然只是临时的 - 谢谢 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Provisionally, of course. - Thank you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.27,0:33:32.41,Note,0,0,0,0,,（无威胁）
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.34,0:33:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 探测器检测到西南方有地震性活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, sensors detecting seismic activity to the southwest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.65,0:33:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概只是小地震 派一个小队去看看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably just a tremor, but have a team check it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.76,0:34:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的小武器盒子在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's our little weapons case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.70,0:34:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你们三个 看好钻车\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. You three, guard the machines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.10,0:35:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打搅您很抱歉 长官 - 没关系 下士\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry to disturb you, sir. - That's all right, Corporal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.40,0:35:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里需要您签名 这儿和这儿 还有这儿和这儿…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to sign here, here and here. And also here, here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.68,0:35:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, sweetheart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.69,0:35:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊你从不杀女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. You don't kill women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.36,0:35:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于你 扎坦 我会网开一面\N{\fnArial\fs30}For you, Zartan, I'd make an exception.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.32,0:36:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是弹头 开伞索！快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warheads, Rip! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.19,0:36:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,上！上！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.43,0:36:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拿到弹头了 预备好「鼹鼠号」准备撤退\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got the warheads. Prep the Mole Pods for evac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.97,0:36:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们就到 - 已开始准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're on our way. - We're already on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.82,0:36:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在怎么离开这儿？- 跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now how do we get out of here? - Follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.39,0:36:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想的美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like that's gonna happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.07,0:36:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到控制室 打开外部舱门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find the control room. Open the exterior hatch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.37,0:36:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 并控制该区域 - 明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And secure this area. - We're on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.28,0:36:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.23,0:37:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,上！上！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.26,0:37:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会开这东西吗？- 别动！安娜 把箱子放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you fly one of these things? - Don't move! Ana, put the case down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.43,0:37:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 放下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. Done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.51,0:37:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住安娜 站那儿别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop. Ana, stop right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.57,0:37:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不会向我开枪的 不是吗？- 必要的话我会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can't shoot me, can you? - I will if I have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.24,0:37:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你心里 还是那个让我坠入爱河的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deep down, you're still the same man I fell in love with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.05,0:37:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别逼我 - 世事难料 不是吗 公爵？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't force this. - What could have been. Right, Duke?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.68,0:37:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,把箱子给我！该死的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give me the case, God damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.12,0:37:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 动一动我就把她打飞 - 来吧 你已经杀过我一次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Move and I'm gonna blow her away. - Do it. You already killed me once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.03,0:37:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,公爵 小心！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duke, watch out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.87,0:37:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜 放下箱子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ana, drop the case!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.56,0:38:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.38,0:38:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.39,0:38:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,尝尝这个！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.75,0:39:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 天才！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, genius!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.12,0:40:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,回见 公爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you, Duke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.35,0:41:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有多少弹头？- 4个 总统先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How many warheads? - Four, Mr. President.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.42,0:41:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 收到什么恐吓？要求？- 迄今为止没有 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Any threats? Demands? - None so far, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.69,0:41:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们认为这说明恐怖分子还未统一意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}We take this to mean the terrorists are unfocused.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.76,0:41:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有明确的目标 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No clear goals. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.13,0:41:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这说明他们打算使用它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means they intend to use them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.37,0:41:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍克将军情况稳定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}General Hawk is stable now, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.00,0:41:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过他可能要1天或更久才能醒来\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he won't be conscious for another day or so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.44,0:41:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个硬汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's one tough bastard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.32,0:41:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.52,0:41:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吧？- 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You all right? - I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.03,0:41:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不想让人看到我这个样子 - 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I didn't want anyone to see me like this. - Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.06,0:41:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不清 损失好些兄弟 霍克将军受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. All the men we lost, General Hawk wounded, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.23,0:41:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的脖子看起来就不重要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}my neck just doesn't seem important.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.97,0:41:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才差点送了命 你有理由受到关怀\N{\fnArial\fs30}You almost lost your life out there. You have a reason to be concerned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.27,0:41:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我从小到大第一次输\N{\fnArial\fs30}First fight I lost since I was a kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.18,0:41:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸教会了我去赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father taught me to win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.31,0:42:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 我不认为有人能教会别人 每一次每一件事都能胜出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't see how you could teach anybody to win everything every time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.02,0:42:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 看看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, look at you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.92,0:42:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还活着 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still here, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.89,0:42:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被击倒了 就再站起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get knocked down, you get back up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.39,0:42:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许那才是他想你学会的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe that's what he wanted you to learn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.03,0:42:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但依然 那还是一种情感的反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then again, that would be an emotional response, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.03,0:42:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,它无法被解释或量化\N{\fnArial\fs30}one that can't be explained or quantified.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.72,0:42:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 看起来我们今天都见到鬼魂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Looks like we're all seeing ghosts today, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.42,0:42:54.74,Note,0,0,0,0,,（东京 20年前）
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.25,0:43:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,[日语] 小贼！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.45,0:44:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,白幽灵！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Storm Shadow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.17,0:44:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,[日语] 他偷东西吃
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.82,0:44:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,说英语 白幽灵 你的礼节呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}English, Storm Shadow. Where are your manners?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.33,0:44:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is hungry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.16,0:44:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要请他加入 指引他的方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to invite him in and show him the path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.67,0:44:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是条野狗 是弱者 - 他打起来可不弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He is a cur, a weakling! - He does not fight like one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.28,0:44:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你叫什么名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, what shall we call you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.85,0:44:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我一位祖先留下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This belonged to an ancestor of mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.92,0:45:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他因为向交战双方出售军火被捕\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was caught selling arms to both sides.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.42,0:45:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,法国人迫使他戴着这个度过余生\N{\fnArial\fs30}The French forced him to wear it for the rest of his life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.73,0:45:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们叫他迪斯特罗 诸国毁灭者\N{\fnArial\fs30}They called him Destro, destroyer of nations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.77,0:45:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么留着它？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why do you keep it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.30,0:45:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样我才能记住军火买卖中的重要守则\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that I never forget the most important rule in dealing arms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.07,0:45:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我猜猜 永远不卖给交战的双方？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess. Never sell to both sides?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.74,0:45:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远不要在卖的时候被抓到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never get caught selling to both sides.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.24,0:45:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,把弹头带到巴黎 激活它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the warheads to Paris. Have them weaponized.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.61,0:45:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 接着我要你测试一枚 - 测试一枚？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then I want you to test one. - Test one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.85,0:45:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要通过美国有线新闻网 让全世界看看它们表现有多好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll let CNN show the world how well they perform.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.99,0:45:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐惧是一种强大的驱动力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fear is a great motivator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.46,0:45:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一个理想的目标 让法国人永世难忘的目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a target in mind, one the French will never forget, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.43,0:45:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我永远忘不了 他们怎么对待克兰·麦卡伦一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}as I've never forgotten what they did to Clan McCullen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.64,0:45:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备好了吗 扎坦先生？- 生下来就准备好了 博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you ready, Mr. Zartan? - Born ready, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.68,0:45:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这将会是我一生的伟大成就\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is going to be the achievement of a lifetime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.75,0:46:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 作为一个伪装大师 你将无人能敌 我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, as a master of disguise, you have no equal, my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.82,0:46:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,花了18个月来学习我的目标 学习他的小癖好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eighteen months of studying my target, learning mannerisms, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.86,0:46:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,越是细节越是险恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the devil is in the details.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.76,0:46:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们 我们开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, let's get it going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.63,0:46:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.93,0:46:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的大脑由我控制 非常感谢合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll control my own brain, thank you very much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.00,0:46:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.22,0:46:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哇 有点让人不舒服 - 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wow. That was a bit nasty. - Think so?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.03,0:46:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们作几个测试看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's run some tests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.33,0:46:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼睛颜色 皮肤颜色 毛发分布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eye color. Skin tone. Hair follicles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.84,0:46:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始面部重组测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}And initiating facial reconstruction tests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.35,0:47:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要找到谁是他们背后的主子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta find out who's holding their leash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.15,0:47:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,有着这样的装备资本和情报 这些家伙都是顶尖的专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}With their weaponry, financing and intel, these guys are high-line pros.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.72,0:47:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,可选的答案就不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That limits the possibilities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.52,0:47:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 那个武器箱 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, the weapons case. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.93,0:47:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得吗？麦卡伦让我们打开武器箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, McCullen had us open the weapons case?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.63,0:47:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那又如何？- 我打赌他当时给了我们一个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about it? - I bet you he gave us a code{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.43,0:47:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,重新启动追踪信号器的密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}that reactivated the tracking beacon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.70,0:47:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对 麦卡伦 这狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. McCullen, that son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.30,0:47:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说 麦卡伦利用北约 资助他的武器研发\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, McCullen uses NATO to fund his R&D{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.77,0:47:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后又把那些弹头偷回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then he steals the warheads back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.54,0:47:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁说过你脑子不好使呢？- 嘿 我找到她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And who says you're not a thinker? - Hey, I found her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.35,0:47:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 没错是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's her all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.81,0:47:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,她名字是安娜·迪·科布雷 或者男爵夫人 如果你觉得这样正式点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her name is Ana de Cobray. Baroness, if you're feeling formal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.82,0:47:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,男爵夫人？哇 她真找到了好东家 说的是钱 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baroness? Wow, she really traded up, huh? Financially, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.46,0:47:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是谁？- 丹尼尔·迪·科布雷\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's he? - Daniel de Cobray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.62,0:47:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,法国科学家大亨 在巴黎有一间实验室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big shot French scientist. Runs a lab in Paris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.46,0:47:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 实验室？什么实验室？- 粒子加速器\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lab? What kind of lab? - Particle accelerator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.67,0:47:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天 他们打算利用他来激活弹头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. They're going to use him to weaponize the warheads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.97,0:48:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 这就是她要去的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's where she's going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.07,0:48:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想吃羊角包\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like croissants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.94,0:48:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上 上 上 上！- 快！我们上！我们上！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go, go, go, go! - Come on! Let's go! Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.87,0:48:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,到那辆车那儿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull up on the truck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.40,0:48:40.75,Note,0,0,0,0,,（东非 4年前）
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.05,0:48:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,上 上 上！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.58,0:48:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 两点钟方向！- 上 上 上！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Two o'clock! - Go, go, go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.78,0:48:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,上！快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, let's move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.22,0:48:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到巷子里！- 蹲下！蹲下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- In the alley! - Get down, get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.96,0:48:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到敌人了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.60,0:49:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 左翼还有两个！- 蹲下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Two more on the left! - Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.77,0:49:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,要泡泡糖？对我来说很有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dubble Bubble? It always helps me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.94,0:49:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 嘿 你还好吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Hey, you good?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.31,0:49:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吧？- 还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.68,0:49:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 科研官 该你上了 明白？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Mr. Science Officer, you're up, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.45,0:49:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,4分钟内找不到 就马上出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't find it in four minutes, you get out of there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.45,0:49:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,5分钟后这座房子就会消失 我已经呼叫空袭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That house will not be there in five. I already called for the air strike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.55,0:49:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！我们上！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Here we go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.66,0:49:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你安全了！上 上 上！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you! Go, go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.59,0:49:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我靠！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, crap!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.56,0:49:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,屋顶上！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rooftop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.94,0:49:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 公爵 咱们比赛怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Duke, I gotta level with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.70,0:49:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我最讨厌和你比赛 - 将会是漫长的5分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I hate it when you level with me. - It's going to be a long five minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.78,0:49:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不！来得太早了 太早了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no! It's too early. It's too early!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.65,0:49:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 公爵！- 雷克斯！雷克斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Duke! - Rex! Rex!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.34,0:50:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.45,0:50:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,公爵！快来 要撤退了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duke! Come on. We gotta go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.48,0:50:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要救雷克斯 - 要撤退了 老兄！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I gotta get Rex. - We gotta go, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.08,0:50:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑鹰直升机在等着！我们必须走！你无能为力的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Black Hawk's waiting! We gotta go! Nothing you can do!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.98,0:50:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你无能为力 老兄！快！- 我要救雷克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nothing you can do, man! Come on! - I gotta get Rex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.99,0:50:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,预备 瞄准 开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready. Aim. Fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.46,0:50:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,向前 走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forward, march.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.04,0:51:21.54,Note,0,0,0,0,,（巴黎 法国 早上8：25）
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.61,0:51:28.31,Note,0,0,0,0,,（迪·科布雷科学实验室）
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.38,0:51:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去登记还是我来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you going to sign in or shall I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.94,0:52:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ana?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.95,0:52:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.88,0:52:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！你在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.45,0:52:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是怎么回事？- 我要你为我做些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's going on here? - I need you to do something for me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.49,0:52:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且是件急事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I don't have much time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.02,0:52:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are these things?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.86,0:52:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是武器弹头 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're warheads, dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.36,0:52:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我须要你把它们激活 不然我会把这里的人杀光\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I need you to weaponize them for me, or we'll kill everyone in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.06,0:52:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！这是个民用实验室！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! This is a civilian laboratory!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.53,0:52:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有激活武器所需的对应流程协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have the correct programming protocols for weaponizing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.34,0:52:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,协议就在箱子里 我说了 这是件急事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The protocols are in the case. I told you, I don't have much time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.69,0:52:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 是泡泡糖吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, is that Dubble Bubble?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.09,0:52:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这是最后一块了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's my last piece.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.16,0:52:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 给我 - 好吧 拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, give it to me. - All right, there you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.96,0:52:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊照计划干 红发女郎 面具人 打头阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Stick to the plan. Scarlett, Snake Eyes, take the front.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.00,0:52:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,开伞索 公爵 顾后 断路器就是我们耳目\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rip, Duke, take the back. Breaker will be our eyes and ears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.60,0:52:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会在这里下指令\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give the orders from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.93,0:52:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当我下命令时 照做 明白？- 明白 婆婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You do what I say, when I say. Got it? - Yes, Daddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.29,0:53:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.19,0:53:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它们都激活了 - 谢谢 丹尼尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're all alive. - Merci, Daniel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.84,0:54:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过他再碰你我会杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you I'd kill him if he touched you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.11,0:54:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次我就听你这么说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard you the first time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.78,0:54:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们就要到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we're almost there. Scarlett, you better put your suit on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.45,0:54:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,红发女 你最好把装备穿上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we're almost there. Scarlett, you better put your suit on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.96,0:54:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.37,0:54:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿下那辆悍马 面具人！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take that Hummer, Snake!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.67,0:55:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点 它们每件都值上百万美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful. They're worth millions of dollars each.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.83,0:55:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,百万美元 明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Millions of dollars. Got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.80,0:55:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老天 - 我的错 我的错 下不为例！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jesus. - My bad. My bad. Won't happen again!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.91,0:55:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks a lot, buddy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.71,0:55:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 红发女郎 宝贝 上还是不上？我们要马上进入战斗！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Scarlett, babe. You in or out? We gotta get in this fight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.86,0:55:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,追踪信号良好 抓牢那车别放 面具人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tracking signal is good. Don't let go of that truck, Snake Eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.33,0:56:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那混蛋甩下车顶吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get that bastard off the roof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.20,0:56:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.90,0:56:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 重载 情况有点不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Heavy, it's getting thick out here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.57,0:56:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我知道 他们就朝着交通拥挤的地方开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know. They're driving right into the heaviest traffic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.07,0:56:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这他妈是什么逃跑路线？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of escape route is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.71,0:56:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可能不是想逃跑 他们可能是有个目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they're not trying to escape. Maybe they're heading somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.85,0:57:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 潜在的目标？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Possible target? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.15,0:57:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,有很多金属的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some place with a lot of metal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.29,0:57:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们要把它毁掉 大家注意！- 兄弟们 你们要阻止他们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're going to blow it up. All units! - Guys, you have to stop them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.30,0:57:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊我们在努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we're working on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.90,0:57:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说立刻！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean right now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.00,0:57:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要在埃菲尔铁塔上引爆一枚弹头！\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're going to detonate one of the warheads on the Eiffel Tower!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.60,0:57:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,碾碎他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crush him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.94,0:57:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,面具人！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snake!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.95,0:58:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在下面 杀了他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's underneath. Kill him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.83,0:58:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个红毛的确开始令我愤怒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That redhead is really starting to piss me off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.93,0:58:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.07,0:58:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 老天！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.84,0:58:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我接到你了 接到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you. I got you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.04,0:58:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干的不错 小家伙 - 喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice save, slick. - Come on, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.18,0:58:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,别从现在就开始对我动心 该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't start being all nice to me now. Gotta go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.42,0:58:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,上来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.59,0:58:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 开伞索 让我们把它拿下！抓紧了 面具人！\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Rip, let's take this thing down! Hang on, Snake!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.47,0:58:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,试下这个是否合身 孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try this on for size, boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.55,0:59:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 该死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.57,0:59:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跟丢了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lost them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.41,0:59:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿过街对面那座建筑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut through that building across the street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.07,0:59:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 门在哪了？- 做一个！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's the door? - Make one!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.78,0:59:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错！来吧 开伞索！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right! Come on, Rip!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.51,0:59:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了 我来了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming. I'm coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.55,0:59:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没看见他们！在哪呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have them! Where are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.84,1:00:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们要接近铁塔了 - 我们只有两公里远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're evacuating the Tower. - We're only 2 kilometers away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.54,1:00:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,面具人 我们没有时间了 你要做些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snake, we're running out of time. You gotta do something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.74,1:00:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不做就永远没机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's now or never.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.59,1:00:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他放弃了 - 他从不会放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He gave up. - He never gives up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.57,1:00:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿过去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming through!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.66,1:01:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 太疯狂了 我从没想过这种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, that was crazy. I didn't expect that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.20,1:01:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么了？- 我穿过了火车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened to you? - I went through the train.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.73,1:01:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你呢？- 我跳过了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened to you? - I jumped over it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.64,1:01:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能这么做？- 是啊我告诉过你读读手册\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can do that? - Yeah. I told you to read that manual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.77,1:01:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,有手册？\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a manual?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.35,1:01:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一次 我来开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time, I'll drive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.86,1:01:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿 拿着制动开关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Take the kill switch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.41,1:01:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 把路让开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Get out of the way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.58,1:01:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 伙计们 他们还活着 而且正在移动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys, they're alive and they're on the move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.85,1:01:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们已经激活了弹头 我现在追踪一下制动开关\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they've activated the warhead. I'm tracking the kill switch now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.62,1:02:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,公爵！公爵 它在男爵夫人身上！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duke! Duke, it's on the Baroness!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.92,1:02:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,白幽灵拿着一个弹头 而且已上膛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Storm Shadow has one of the warheads, and it's armed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.27,1:02:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,都给我闪开！闪开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of my way! Get out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.90,1:02:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.61,1:02:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,鞋很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice shoes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.42,1:02:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去追弹头 我去追制动开关\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get the warhead, I'll get the kill switch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.09,1:02:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 这就去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.34,1:03:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 那个忍者真快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn, that ninja's fast!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.48,1:03:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.47,1:03:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.45,1:03:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 超级惨烈了 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bloody hell. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.01,1:04:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会吃掉整个城市的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna eat through the entire city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.48,1:04:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,公爵 你一定要按下开关！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duke, you have to hit that kill switch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.65,1:04:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.11,1:05:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤害解除\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disarmed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.79,1:05:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜了 公爵 你刚刚拯救了巴黎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations, Duke. You just saved Paris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.13,1:05:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者说大部分巴黎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or at least most of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.62,1:06:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是血吗？- 意大利面条酱 别问了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that blood? - Spaghetti sauce. Don't ask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.69,1:06:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们抓走了公爵 - 我们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They got Duke. - We know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.96,1:06:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在做什么？- 插入他的大脑皮层里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - Plugging into his cerebral cortex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.57,1:06:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌打断你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate to break the news to you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.70,1:06:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我觉得在他死掉的情况下 他不会给你什么信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I don't think he's gonna give you much in his dead condition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.07,1:06:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,大脑在人死的几分钟内还会存活\N{\fnArial\fs30}The brain survives a couple of minutes after death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.04,1:06:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以提取他最近的记忆搭载的电脉冲\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can retrieve the electrical impulses from his most recent memories{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.77,1:06:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后把它们转化成图像 - 那么我们能找到公爵么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and convert them to images. - Well, can we find Duke?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.98,1:06:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们首先要找到其他三个弹头\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to find the other three warheads first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.64,1:06:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这个家伙记得回家的路 或许我们都能找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this guy remembers his way home, maybe we can find both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.65,1:06:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 图像出来了 让我们看看这个家伙从哪来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, here come the images. Let's see where this guy's been.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.42,1:06:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他还活着 - 不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's still alive! - He can't be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.56,1:06:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,有3寸的针头扎在他脑袋里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got 3-inch needles in his head!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.73,1:06:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂 死人不会跳霹雳舞！- 怎么回事 断路器？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, dead guys don't breakdance! - What's happening, Breaker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.93,1:06:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 纳米虫 正在吃掉他 - 一定是某种自我毁灭装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nanomites, they're eating him. - Must be some sort of self-destruct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.83,1:06:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 断路器！- 快 快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hurry, Breaker! - Come on, come on, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.97,1:06:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.07,1:06:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.21,1:06:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,美丽的纳米技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}The beauty of nanotechnology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.35,1:06:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们被耍了 - 放心 我得到了可以得到的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We are screwed. - Relax. I got everything I could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.65,1:07:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？那你刚才说「不 不 不」是什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Then what the hell was the, "No, no, no, no!" for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.89,1:07:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是给麦卡伦看的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was for McCullen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.15,1:07:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们在看着我们 - 好吧 那你都得到了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They were watching us. - Okay. So what did you get?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.96,1:07:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 不很多 只是些图像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, not that much. Just images.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.42,1:07:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧 老兄 你说过你是这方面最好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Frenchie. I thought you said you was the best at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.43,1:07:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是这方面最好的！- 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I am the best at this! - All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.83,1:07:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没人能做到我做的 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nobody can do what I just did. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.97,1:07:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.83,1:07:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我们做的 我们是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't do it. We're the good guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.44,1:07:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把你的手举起来 开伞索 - 我们没时间了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Put your hands up, Rip. - We don't have time for this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.27,1:07:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不被允许跟友军开战\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not allowed to engage with friendly forces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.11,1:07:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们对我看起来不够友好 我要去救我的兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't look too friendly to me. I gotta get my boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.11,1:07:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看 队长… - 开伞索！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, Captain… - Rip!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.14,1:07:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还在追寻剩下3个弹头的下落 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're still trying to locate the three remaining warheads, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.47,1:07:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 特种兵们怎么样了？- 他们被羁押了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's the status of the Joes? - They've been detained.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.38,1:08:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 法国人相当沮丧 - 他们当然沮丧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The French are pretty upset. - Of course they're upset.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.55,1:08:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我见法国大使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me the French Ambassador.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.52,1:08:11.52,Note,0,0,0,0,,（法国反恐局）
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.52,1:08:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,几秒钟内被一个导弹击中…\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a matter of seconds by a strike by a missile…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.43,1:08:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 不 不要！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.03,1:08:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,请不要碰它！那是我的设备 非常的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't touch that! That's my equipment. It's very…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.33,1:08:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 他已经碰了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, he's touching it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.27,1:08:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干的不错啊强人 - 不是他的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice going, slick. - It's not his fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.47,1:08:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是太感性了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just emotional.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.14,1:08:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我来看看 - 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here, let me look at that. - I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.34,1:08:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,只想帮帮你 将军！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just trying to help. General!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.69,1:08:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,法国人同意让你们离开 条件是你们不能再回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The French have agreed to let you all go on the condition that none of you return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.56,1:08:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.69,1:08:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 永远？- 这就算不错的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Never? - It could be worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.96,1:08:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说永远是什么意思？是说再也不能 永远不能？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean by never? Like, never, never, ever?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.70,1:08:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.27,1:08:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们所有人都被你们各自国家的头头召回\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of you have been recalled by your respective heads of state.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.94,1:09:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,A小队要返回地下基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Team Alpha is to return to the Pit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.71,1:09:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那公爵怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Duke?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.18,1:09:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,联系麦卡伦 告诉他我们带着3个弹头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call McCullen. Tell him we have the three warheads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.58,1:09:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上就做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.35,1:09:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你不杀了我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you just kill me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.42,1:09:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦卡伦对你有一些特别的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}McCullen has something special in mind for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.39,1:09:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦卡伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}McCullen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.73,1:09:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.36,1:09:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在在乎了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you care?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.13,1:09:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.57,1:09:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.14,1:09:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抱歉雷克斯的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry about Rex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.84,1:09:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抱歉我未能把雷克斯带回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry that I couldn't bring Rex home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.38,1:09:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还抱歉那件事以后我无法再面对你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm so sorry that I couldn't face you afterwards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.82,1:09:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊每个人都有抱歉的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, everybody's sorry about something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.92,1:10:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,[日语] 恭喜成为顶级高手！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.92,1:10:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,师傅！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.85,1:10:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,师傅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.74,1:11:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 公爵怎么办？我们就这样把他忘了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so what about Duke? We're just gonna forget about him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.11,1:11:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有我们的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got our orders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.41,1:11:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄你看 如果是你们中的一人会怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, what if it was one of your guys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.45,1:11:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是红发女或者断路器呢？你们又会怎么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if it was Scarlett or Breaker? What would you do then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.05,1:11:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来非常远 或许是个好地方作为基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks pretty remote. Might be a good location for a base.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.52,1:11:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,雪！让我想到了什么 地球的三分之一？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snow. That leaves us with what, a third of the earth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.39,1:11:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.76,1:11:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂 那是麦卡伦的影子么？- 发现了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, is that McCullen's shadow? - What you got?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.20,1:11:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 球面三角学 - 我一定没选那门课\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Spherical trigonometry. - I must have missed that class.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.67,1:11:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你知道物体的高度 和影子的长度\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you know the height of the object, the length of the shadow, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.73,1:11:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有捕捉到的图像的时间日期\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the time and date that the image was captured, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.27,1:11:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你就可以找出他的位置 - 这就是我为什么没选这门课\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you can figure out its location. - That's why I missed that class.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.57,1:11:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 断路器 给我看看 我们发现了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Breaker, give it to me. What have we got?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.44,1:11:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 麦卡伦是180身高 他的影子是46厘米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. McCullen is 180 centimeters tall. His shadow is 46 centimeters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.75,1:11:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个图像有6%的衰期\N{\fnArial\fs30}This image has decayed 6%, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.58,1:12:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说在51小时17分钟前\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means it's 51 hours and 17 minutes old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.48,1:12:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是在北极冰冠\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's at the polar icecap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.42,1:12:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 重载 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Heavy. - Yep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.69,1:12:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么看 先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.76,1:12:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说你们被命令回到地下基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said you've been ordered back to the Pit, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.16,1:12:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我没说何时 而且我也没说走哪条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I didn't say when and I didn't say which route to take.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.47,1:12:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许走向北的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe a northern one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.29,1:12:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多的冰川\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is a lot of ice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.95,1:12:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,上千英里的跨度 10层楼的厚度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thousands of miles across and 10 stories thick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.39,1:12:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到麦卡伦的基地好似在煤矿里找根针\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locating McCullen's base will be like finding a needle in a coal mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.43,1:12:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干草垛 - 哦 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Haystack. - Oh, right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.93,1:12:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,在煤矿里找干草垛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haystack in a coal mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.55,1:13:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！麦卡伦留着他有用！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! McCullen has plans for him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.89,1:13:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.17,1:14:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么打算的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what was your plan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.31,1:14:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,在冰面上跑3000英里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run 3, 000 miles across the ice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.95,1:14:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,愚蠢的战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.92,1:14:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.79,1:14:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很奇怪 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's strange. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.99,1:14:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他们偷走箱子的时候 我设置了我的接收仪\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they stole the weapons case, I set my scanner{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.80,1:14:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦追踪信号返回 就可以收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}to look out for the tracking beacon in case it came back on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.17,1:14:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 而刚刚我收到了 - 那是我兄弟！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And it just came back on. - That's my boy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.02,1:14:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,还剩三个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.16,1:15:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这些弹头装在导弹上 我要一小时内准备好发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the warheads to the missiles. I want them ready to launch in one hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.16,1:15:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will be done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.91,1:15:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的湖中女神\N{\fnArial\fs30}My beautiful Lady of the Lake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.45,1:15:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你很不自在？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This bother you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.72,1:15:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,很搞笑的 不是么？整个世界的权力均衡即将改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's funny, isn't it? The entire balance of power in the world about to shift, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.96,1:15:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,而两个家伙还在这争女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}two guys can still have a stare-down over who gets the girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.88,1:15:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让你非常不高兴的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna make you very unhappy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.11,1:15:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我已经很不高兴了 - 起来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm already unhappy. - Get up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.43,1:16:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,生物相机的影像正在传回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Video from the Aqua Cam is coming online now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.56,1:16:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bloody hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.33,1:16:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在北极冰冠下建了一个军事基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've built a military base under the polar icecap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.47,1:16:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,完美的地点 几乎不可探测到 很容易防御\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the perfect location. Nearly undetectable, easily defensible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.47,1:16:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 公爵一定在里面 - 还有弹头\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Duke's got to be in there somewhere. - And the warheads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.14,1:16:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要找到一条秘密的路进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to find a quiet way to get inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.75,1:16:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,电梯缆绳 在地表有入口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elevator cables. They've got a surface entrance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.62,1:16:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家看 还有些其他的 转入声纳模式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, there's something else. Going to sonar view.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.55,1:16:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在冰层里打穿了隧道\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've got tunnels running through the ice pack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.96,1:16:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 看 他们有自己的攻击潜艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look, they've got their own attack subs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.33,1:16:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, what's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.93,1:16:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 导弹筒 - 一定用于发射纳米弹头\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Missile tubes. - Must be for the nanomite warheads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.70,1:16:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们上升 我要从外面给他们点麻烦 让他们忙不过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take us up. I'll create a distraction from outside and keep them busy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.07,1:16:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你们从上面潜入到建筑内 我们会找到公爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}while you lot infiltrate the facility from above. We'll find Duke…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.77,1:16:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拿回弹头 - 杀死所有的坏蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Grab the warheads. - Kill all the bad guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.21,1:16:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道 A组在直接的命令下\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you all know, Team Alpha is under direct orders{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.51,1:16:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,即将返回他们各自国家的基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}to return to their respective national bases.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.04,1:16:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我有些事情需要做 这样做会违反命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have something I need to do which goes against all orders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.05,1:17:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以如果你们有谁决定现在离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, if any of you decide that you have to leave now, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.89,1:17:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定不会拦着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will certainly not hold it against you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.67,1:17:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.90,1:17:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们打算怎么用那些弹头？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do with the warheads?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.17,1:17:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是训练有素 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take to your training well. That's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.97,1:17:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,仍然想发掘出一些情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still trying to develop intel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.84,1:17:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那么你不会介意告诉我 - 不是很显然么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So you won't mind telling me. - Isn't it obvious?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.14,1:17:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是生意人 我要用了它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a businessman. I'm going to use them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.44,1:17:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你发射了那些弹头 上百万人会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Millions of people are gonna die if you launch those warheads, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.01,1:17:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你会得到什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}so what is it that you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.15,1:17:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这个星球上的每一个男人女人小孩身上 注入恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}To strike fear into the hearts of every man, woman and child on the planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.95,1:17:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他们就会转而投向最有力量的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then they'll turn to the person with the most power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.29,1:17:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.02,1:17:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.63,1:17:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还没有看到全部 - 那么告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're not seeing the whole picture. - Then tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.89,1:17:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想浪费了惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna spoil the surprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.34,1:17:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,客人到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.44,1:18:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,见一下纳米科技背后的天才吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet the genius behind all my nanotechnology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.38,1:18:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,天才？你太客气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Genius? You are too kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.58,1:18:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以看到 我们正装载纳米弹头\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you can see, we are loading my nanomite warheads{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.82,1:18:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,利用高速导弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}into the high-V missiles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.75,1:18:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,当达到最大速度时 会有5马赫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once at maximum velocity, Mach 5, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.86,1:18:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至连特种部队都没有技术来抓住它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}not even the Joes have the technology to catch them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.16,1:18:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么他是谁？又一个新兵？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, who's this? Another recruit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.26,1:18:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过是一个不太情愿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Albeit a rather unwilling one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.37,1:18:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会为他准备好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll prepare him for the procedure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.02,1:18:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有队伍注意 我是霍克将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}All teams, listen up, this is General Hawk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.76,1:18:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动开始 重复一遍 行动开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mission is a go. I say again, the mission is a go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.56,1:18:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好运 特种兵们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck, Joes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.89,1:19:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所有队伍都部署完毕 长官 - 给我一个卫星信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The teams have been deployed, sir. - Get me a satellite uplink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.56,1:19:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要看见那里发生的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna see everything that's going on down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.88,1:19:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发现了什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You picking up anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.15,1:19:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 仪器上什么都没显示\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negative. There's nothing on the scanner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.13,1:20:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打得不错 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice shooting. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.76,1:20:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们离迈阿密真的很远啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're a long way from Miami.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.93,1:20:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是夜鸦 他们的确造了一架\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a Night Raven. They actually built one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.87,1:20:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来很快 那个麦卡伦搞了不少经费\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks fast. That McCullen got some gadgets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.84,1:20:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,MARS工业生产了这个星球上70%的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}MARS Industries manufactures 70% of all arms on this planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.68,1:20:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,70%\N{\fnArial\fs30}70%.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.45,1:20:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这点吗 公爵？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know that, Duke?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.09,1:20:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦卡伦的计划里包括两个方面 剑与盾\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are two sides to McCullen's operation, the Sword and the Shield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.26,1:20:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,剑就是创造和贩卖武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Sword creates and sells weaponry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.83,1:20:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,盾就是创造出防御性科技 例如高科技掩体\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Shield creates defensive technology, like high-tech bunkers, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.33,1:20:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以保护你免受任何袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}which are supposed to protect one from anything{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.50,1:20:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论是核爆炸还是纳米弹头\N{\fnArial\fs30}from a nuclear blast to a nanomite warhead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.50,1:20:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不幸的是 我当时避难的掩体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, the bunker in which I took shelter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.84,1:20:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,还只是个雏形\N{\fnArial\fs30}was just a prototype.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.64,1:20:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.79,1:21:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷克斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rex?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.13,1:21:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个婊子养的！安娜安葬了你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch! Ana buried you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.83,1:21:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,感人的仪式 我肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moving ceremony, I'm sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.37,1:21:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸣枪仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}The three-volley salute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.53,1:21:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,战场荣耀 折叠的国旗在她胳膊上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boots on the ground. A folded flag in her arms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.64,1:21:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？为什么你不出现呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Why didn't you just come in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.17,1:21:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我发现了一些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I discovered something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.31,1:21:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,…项目编号23\N{\fnArial\fs30}…subject number 23.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.52,1:21:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只会有点疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will only hurt a little.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.52,1:21:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,即将发生的 会更美\N{\fnArial\fs30}What comes next, more so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.02,1:21:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 光头博士不惜任何代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Mindbender, do whatever it takes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.59,1:21:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也会\N{\fnArial\fs30}So will I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.16,1:21:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得 科学需要献身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, science requires sacrifice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.70,1:21:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很美吧 不是么？- 待着别动！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's beautiful, isn't it? - Stay where you are!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.60,1:21:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要开枪射我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you going to shoot me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.70,1:21:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些不是化学或者核物质 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}These aren't chemical or nuclear, are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.71,1:21:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.98,1:21:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是更好的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're something much, much better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.38,1:21:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,很美丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.78,1:22:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳米螨虫 它超越了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nanomites, it's beyond…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.62,1:22:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,它比这领域其他任何人做的都要超前\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's light years ahead of what anyone else is doing in the field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.75,1:22:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,空袭警报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proximity alert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.36,1:22:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,空中袭击临近 所有人员到掩体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aerial attack imminent. All personnel to the bunker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.73,1:22:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快！干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on! What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.50,1:22:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？不要关门 不要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? Don't close that. Don't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.27,1:22:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们活着 我会让你见识一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we live, I'll show you everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.25,1:22:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在爆炸中幸存了 不过…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We survived that blast, somewhat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.25,1:22:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,光头博士和我带着他的研究逃掉了 而我完善了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Dr. Mindbender and I escaped with his research, which I perfected{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.65,1:22:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在将带给你第一手的体验\N{\fnArial\fs30}and which you will now experience first-hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.82,1:22:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜知道这件事吗 关于你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does Ana know about this? About you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.19,1:22:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 她不会知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, and she never will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.33,1:22:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始发射进程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commence the launch sequence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.00,1:22:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始发射进程 时间倒数 四三二一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commencing launch sequence. T-minus four, three, two, one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.01,1:22:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,点燃主引擎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ignite primary engines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.01,1:23:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,引擎启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have ignition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.42,1:23:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们正在发射导弹！\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're launching the missiles!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.49,1:23:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们失去了北京的导弹 失去了3号弹头 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lost the Beijing missile. Warhead three is down, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.86,1:23:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所有防御戒备 - 好的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Alert all defenses. - Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.99,1:23:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.91,1:24:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 另外两个怎么办？- 我们要找到启动开关\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about the other two? - We gotta find the kill switches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.37,1:24:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们太远了超出了范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're already way too far out of range.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.64,1:24:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,要有人飞上去然后把它们打下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody has to get up there and shoot those things down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.45,1:24:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我猜那该是我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess that's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.55,1:24:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 先生 - 什么情况？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir. - What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.95,1:24:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,战略中心追踪到了3个弹头\N{\fnArial\fs30}STRATCOM is tracking three warheads{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.99,1:24:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚从北极冰冠发射了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that have just launched off the polar icecap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.85,1:24:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中一个立刻被打掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}One was downed immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.96,1:24:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外两个现在进入了上层大气\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other two are currently entering the upper atmosphere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.96,1:24:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要把你送入掩体里 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get you down to the bunker, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.49,1:24:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他们还没提任何条件 他们怎么想的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they haven't made any demands. What's their plan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.53,1:24:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个东西真的酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this is very cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.03,1:24:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 不过你能飞起来吗？- 我可以飞起来任何东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, but can you fly it? - I can fly anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.44,1:24:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要找到方法指引我找到弹头\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just find a way to guide me to those warheads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.07,1:24:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 开伞索… - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right. Ripcord… - Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.24,1:24:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 祝好运 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good luck. - Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.38,1:24:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂 帮我个忙 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, do me a favor. - Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.21,1:24:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 救下公爵 - 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Save Duke. - You got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.86,1:24:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.47,1:25:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,地上是压力板还有镭射保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}The floor is pressure-plated and laser-protected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.87,1:25:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何大于1夸特重量的东西接触地面 都会被烤熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything larger than a quarter that touches that floor gets fried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.11,1:25:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你丢下我不管 公爵 看看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You left me for dead, Duke, and look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.49,1:25:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你会知道怪物会是什么样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you'll know what it's like to be a monster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.53,1:25:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们时间不多了 - 安娜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We don't have much time. - Ana?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.31,1:25:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.64,1:25:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安娜！- 警卫 来控制室！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ana! - Security, to the operating chamber!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.31,1:25:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 雷克斯！- 我按下这个 她就死\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rex! - I press this, she dies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.95,1:25:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你对你自己的姐姐这么做！- 我爱我的姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You did this to your own sister! - I loved my sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.29,1:26:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我的死让她成什么样了 而你又离开？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea the state she was in with me dead, you gone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.49,1:26:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾经感觉到真正的孤独吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever felt truly alone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.40,1:26:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给了她一种疗伤的办法 我给了她意志\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave her a way to deal with the pain. I gave her purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.63,1:26:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以告诉她你活着 这一切就不必发生！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could have stopped all of this just by letting her know you were alive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.57,1:26:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,科学需要献身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Science requires sacrifice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.87,1:26:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,她那样子都是因为你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}All she's done was because of you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.41,1:26:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你 公爵 你离弃了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}And because of you, Duke. You abandoned her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.61,1:26:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不要忘记这一点 - 我要杀了你 雷克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's not forget that point. - I'm gonna kill you, Rex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.45,1:26:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她还活着吗？- 现在活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is she still alive? - For now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.59,1:26:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我们完全控制住了 你说过这不会发生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we had complete control. You said this couldn't happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.36,1:26:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也以为不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't think it could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.49,1:26:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没见过有人凌驾在程序之上 哪怕是片刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen anyone override the programming, even momentarily.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.23,1:26:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,她因为他做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She did this for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.56,1:26:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,痛苦一定在折磨她\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pain must have been excruciating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.68,1:26:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要做的就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you'll have to do{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.38,1:26:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心地把镭射板的核心重新接线…\N{\fnArial\fs30}is to rewire the laser panel's brain by carefully…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.82,1:27:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 或者你可以直接捅破它 - 我是红发女 我们进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Or you can just stab it. - This is Scarlett. We're in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.02,1:27:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,派遣特种潜艇！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deploy the SHARCs!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.82,1:27:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,潜艇1-3号分离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detaching SHARCs 1-3…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.19,1:27:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,分离潜艇 ABCD\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detaching SHARCs Alpha, Bravo, Charlie, Delta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.19,1:27:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 全速前进 - 分离潜艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Full speed ahead. - Detaching SHARCs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.80,1:27:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,潜艇VFT进入侧翼位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}SHARCs Victor, Franklin, Tango into flanking positions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.30,1:27:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 大家 组成攻击阵型\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, boys. Attack formation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.05,1:27:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,扇形展开 等待特种兵们打乱阵型\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fan out. Wait until the Joes break formation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.05,1:27:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持紧密 他们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay tight. Here they come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.34,1:28:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 激发脉冲大炮！- 正在做 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fire up the pulse cannon! - We're on it, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.18,1:28:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会下手的！- 放下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll do it! - Put it down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.68,1:28:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,在于你 公爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your choice, Duke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.92,1:28:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,给脉冲大炮充电\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charging pulse cannon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.10,1:28:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家保持在敌人潜艇周围\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody stay tight on the enemy craft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.90,1:28:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要暴露在大炮面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let that cannon catch you out in the open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.87,1:28:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,10点钟方向来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bogey at 10 o'clock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.67,1:28:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我中弹了！我中了！我中了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hit! I'm hit! I'm hit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.51,1:28:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,2枚导弹 所有遥测和推进系统工作正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missile 2, all telemetry and propulsion systems nominal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.17,1:29:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开伞索 能听见我吗？- 清清楚楚 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ripcord, can you hear me? - Loud and clear, buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.51,1:29:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,开到6马赫 太爽了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doing Mach 6 and loving it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.51,1:29:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 该告诉我你们的知道的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, girl. Time to show me what you got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.08,1:29:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 开伞索 我有其他两枚弹头的坐标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Rip, I have the coordinates of the other two warheads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.09,1:29:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近的目标是莫斯科 你要首先打掉这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}The closest target is Moscow. You'll have to hit that one first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.86,1:29:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标二是华盛顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target two is Washington.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.66,1:29:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这个掩体里会安全的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be safe down in this bunker, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.16,1:29:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有多久会袭击到这？- 十七分钟 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How soon before it strikes the city? - Seventeen minutes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.00,1:29:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在就看特种部队的了 - 请快进入 总统先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's all up to the Joes now. - Please hurry, Mr. President.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.50,1:29:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要把门锁住\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get you buttoned up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.29,1:29:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍克将军 引擎被击中 我们完全残废了\N{\fnArial\fs30}General Hawk, we've lost our engines. We're completely disabled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.26,1:29:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人去做掉那个大炮吗 那个艇里有200名特种兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody take out that damn cannon. There's 200 Joes on that sub.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.46,1:30:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在做 先生 好吧 面具人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on it, sir. All right, Snake, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.50,1:30:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,大炮控制室应该就在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}the cannon control room should be right there, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.90,1:30:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有镭射管道汇集处\N{\fnArial\fs30}where all the laser conduits converge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.80,1:30:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为她爱过你？你想过跟她度过一生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you think she loved you? Did you imagine your life with her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.87,1:30:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道的是 你们都不配拥有她\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I know is, neither one of you deserve her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.84,1:30:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就这样吧 她死定了！- 不要这样 雷克斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's it. She dies! - Don't do it, Rex!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.36,1:30:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.93,1:30:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要带你出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get you out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.20,1:30:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.96,1:30:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're coming with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.88,1:30:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,开伞索 莫斯科导弹4分钟内即将到达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ripcord, the Moscow missile will impact in four minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.35,1:30:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我看见它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I got a visual on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.35,1:30:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,正前方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.42,1:31:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要在它重入大气层前把它干下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to knock it down before it re-enters the atmosphere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.79,1:31:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果那些纳米虫击中了地面 一切都毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If those nanomites hit the ground, it's all over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.66,1:31:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会吃掉整个城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll destroy the whole city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.06,1:31:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,休斯顿 出现了问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Houston, we have a problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.70,1:31:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 火控系统不在这 - 什么意思 不在那？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The fire controls are not in here. - What do you mean, not in there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.33,1:31:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我到处都找不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I don't see them anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.87,1:31:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就一定是声控的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must be voice-activated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.34,1:31:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 开火！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.57,1:31:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射！轰炸！开枪呀！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot! Blast away! Bust a cap!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.25,1:31:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没反应！- 我猜是用另一种语言\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nothing's happening! - I bet it's in a different language.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.45,1:31:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 麦卡伦是苏格兰人 或许飞机听凯尔特语指令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. McCullen is Scottish. Maybe the plane responds to Celtic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.72,1:31:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 试试「铁尼」 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Try Teine. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.89,1:31:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 铁尼 是苏格兰凯尔特语开火的意思 - 好的 收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Teine. It's Celt, Scottish for fire. - Okay, got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.70,1:31:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是最棒的 你刚拯救了莫斯科\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice going, ace. You just saved Moscow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.17,1:31:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,本职工作而已 指引我去华盛顿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just doing my job. Now guide me to Washington.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.31,1:32:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好 谢谢 真是好消息 我会告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, thanks, that's great news. I'll let him know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.52,1:32:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 一名特种兵射掉了发向莫斯科的弹头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, one of the Joes shot down the warhead heading for Moscow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.45,1:32:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.42,1:32:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么？哦 上帝！\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.90,1:32:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.25,1:32:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 总统先生 麦卡伦先生向您表示问候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Mr. President. Mr. McCullen sends his regards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.85,1:32:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.22,1:32:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 这就是你们的目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, that's what this is all about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.46,1:32:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 大家保持紧密\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Keep tight, boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.53,1:32:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有武器对准那门大炮 电动鱼雷发射！\N{\fnArial\fs30}All guns on that cannon. Torpedoes away!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.21,1:33:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚失去了侧翼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've just lost my wingman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.44,1:33:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,重新瞄准特种兵潜艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Retargeting Joe submarine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.01,1:33:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发射了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.40,1:33:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,脉冲大炮故障 脉冲大炮故障\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pulse cannon fault. Pulse cannon fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.34,1:33:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,大炮控制失效\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cannon now offline.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.72,1:33:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 整个该死的系统都瘫了 - 我正试着重新连接控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The whole damn system's down. - I'm trying to bring it back online.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.03,1:33:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.05,1:34:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Launch immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.42,1:34:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找条路从冰层往上走 - 好的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Chart a course up to the ice pack. - Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.97,1:34:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们要跟着雷克斯和麦卡伦 - 怎么会是雷克斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We gotta go after Rex and McCullen. - How could it be Rex?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.04,1:34:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 红发女 我是公爵！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Scarlett, it's Duke!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.01,1:34:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他看起来还好 - 不过他怎么跟她在一起？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He looks fine. - But what's he doing with her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.89,1:35:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跟踪了麦卡伦的潜艇 他在冰层里行进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we got a track on McCullen's sub. He's headed up into the ice pack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.13,1:35:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,公爵 我们后面！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duke, behind us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.00,1:35:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,貌似他们冲我们来的 安娜 打掉那些家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like they're onto us. Ana, shoot those guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.27,1:35:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,乐意效劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.65,1:36:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我们师父被杀 你发誓要一直沉默\N{\fnArial\fs30}When our master was killed, you took a vow of silence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.12,1:36:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你也将不留一言地死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you will die without a word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.43,1:36:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我看见第二个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, the second one in my sights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.87,1:36:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 开伞索 你在它进入低层大气前只有30秒的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Rip, you only got 30 seconds before it enters the lower atmosphere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.25,1:36:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.56,1:36:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开伞索 你失手了 - 弹头已经进入了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ripcord, you missed. - The warhead has entered{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.16,1:36:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,低层大气层\N{\fnArial\fs30}the lower atmosphere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.26,1:36:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我知道！我在努力 我在努力！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, I know! I'm on it, I'm on it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.13,1:36:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.34,1:36:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没法摆脱这些家伙 - 公爵 我打光了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't shake these guys. - Duke, I'm out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.97,1:36:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 看看我们这还有什么 - 黑光 分离器 镭射炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right, let's see what we got here. - Black Ray, Eliminator, LAW.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.67,1:36:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,镭射炮 听起来不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laser Artillery Weapon. That sounds good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.72,1:37:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 红发女！- 嗨 公爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Scarlett! - Hey, Duke!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.02,1:37:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去跟着麦卡伦和雷克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going after McCullen and Rex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.19,1:37:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们大家最好赶紧离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys better get the hell out of there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.35,1:37:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 开伞索还有一个弹头没打下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't. Rip has one more warhead to take down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.49,1:37:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,开伞索 他在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rip, where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.83,1:37:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,导弹刚刚分离了 就要引爆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The missile's just gone drone. It's going in for the kill!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.70,1:38:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 有一艘敌人的螳螂潜艇跟在后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, there's a hostile Mantis craft coming up behind us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.23,1:38:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 关上门 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Seal the door. - Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.97,1:38:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.42,1:38:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,一枚穿过去了 我打中了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}One got through. I hit them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.99,1:38:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,公爵！他们在后面！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duke! They're back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.69,1:38:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上就热闹了 321\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going hot in three, two, one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.78,1:39:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定还有其它路绕到雷克斯和麦卡伦前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gotta be another way around to Rex and McCullen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.55,1:39:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,寻找新的选择路线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charting new course for alternate route.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.96,1:39:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,距离爆炸还有20秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty seconds until impact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.06,1:39:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.96,1:39:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你离得太紧了 开伞索！退一些！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're too close, Rip! Back off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.70,1:39:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 我想我刚刚正好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I think I'm just about close enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.45,1:39:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他带着纳米虫回到上层大气\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's taking the nanomites back into the upper atmosphere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.13,1:40:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,开伞索 离开飞机！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ripcord, get out of that plane!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.60,1:40:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,就要到了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.94,1:40:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹射 开伞索 弹射！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eject, Ripcord, eject!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.88,1:40:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他做到了 他真的做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did it. He actually did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.99,1:40:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,开伞索？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ripcord?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.69,1:40:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,开伞索？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ripcord?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.56,1:40:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,开伞索！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ripcord!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.73,1:40:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没跟你说过不要对我吼吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't I ask you not to yell at me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.33,1:40:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家注意！还有许多特种兵在那里有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody, listen up! We still have a lot of Joes out there in harm's way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.64,1:40:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们带他们回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's bring them home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.18,1:40:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 成功了吗？- 是的 成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did it work? - Yes, yes, it worked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.15,1:40:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 因为我想我又将被逮捕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Because I think I'm about to get arrested, again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.52,1:40:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要动！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.62,1:40:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂 喂 自己人 自己人！- 举起手！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, hey, same team, same team! - Hands up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.29,1:41:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.06,1:41:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.30,1:41:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们什么情况？- 失去了船尾推进器和声纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's our status? - We've lost aft thrusters and the sonar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.53,1:41:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们瞎了 - 杀了他们 杀了所有特种兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're running blind. - Kill them. Kill all the Joes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.27,1:41:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 炸掉冰层 - 这就做 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Detonate the ice pack. - Right away, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.45,1:41:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们正通知告诉其它艇终止行动 他要炸掉冰层\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're telling the other ships to abort. He's gonna blow the ice pack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.68,1:41:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是公爵 呼叫所有特种兵 冰层开始坠下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Duke calling all Joes. The ice pack's coming down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.39,1:41:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,上吨的钢铁和冰\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a ton of steel and ice{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.66,1:41:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 冲着你们去了！- 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- headed your way! - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.69,1:41:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家后退 立刻后退！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody, pull back! Pull back now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.67,1:41:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,门！开门 开门！把门打开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Door! The door, the door! Get the door!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.14,1:41:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.82,1:42:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜 我们该立刻离开这 方便快捷 安全可靠的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ana, we could get out of here right now, free and clear, safe and sound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.66,1:42:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们来搞定他们吧 - 这才是我的安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's get them. - That's my girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.37,1:42:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这里要爆炸了 公爵 - 我不会让那两个家伙跑掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is cutting it close, Duke. - I'm not letting those two get away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.38,1:42:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 大家快离开那！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, guys, get out of there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.99,1:42:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,面具人！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snake!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.43,1:43:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是红发女 我们安全了 - 我是公爵 我们也安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is Scarlett. We're all clear. - This is Duke. We're clear, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.40,1:43:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 瞧瞧我们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, Joe!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.07,1:43:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好喔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.86,1:43:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们有了属于我们的时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that we have a moment to ourselves, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.43,1:43:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我计划了一些事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've designed something{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.96,1:43:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 特别为你准备的 詹姆斯 - 不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- especially for you, James. - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.50,1:44:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只会有一点疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will only hurt a little.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.27,1:44:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,即将发生的 会更美\N{\fnArial\fs30}What comes next, more so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.78,1:44:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳米虫 完美的小治疗法师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nanomites, perfect little healers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.73,1:44:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好不容易继承了麦卡伦家族的祖脉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've finally taken my place in a long line of McCullens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.53,1:44:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯·麦卡伦不复存在 现在你是迪斯特罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}James McCullen is no more. Now you are Destro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.01,1:44:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对我做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you done to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.79,1:44:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了眼镜蛇崛起和显露的时刻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The time has come for the cobra to rise up and reveal himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.13,1:45:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要叫我司令\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will call me Commander.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.04,1:45:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是豪瑟上尉 准备接受我方登艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Captain Duke Hauser. Prepare to be boarded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.82,1:45:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.69,1:45:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很坚韧 公爵 我愿意给你那么高的评价\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are relentless, Duke. I'll give you that much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.42,1:45:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么才能不让我把你炸开到水面上呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what's to stop me from blowing you out of the water?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.29,1:45:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,自我保护 我会帮你的 雷克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Self-preservation. I'm taking you in, Rex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.50,1:45:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟谁的队伍？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and what army?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.74,1:45:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的队伍\N{\fnArial\fs30}My army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.06,1:46:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听着 公爵 这只是个开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Duke, this has only just begun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.33,1:46:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会等着你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be waiting for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.41,1:46:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从未见过这种编码 我是说 身体上看她还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen encoding like this. I mean, physically, she's fine, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:27.35,1:46:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过当雷克斯给他们输入了程序 他就没想要取出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}but when Rex programmed them, he sure didn't want them taken out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:30.08,1:46:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那你们就没什么可做的了？- 会需要一些时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So there's nothing you can do for her? - It'll take some time, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.52,1:46:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们会取出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we'll take them out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.39,1:46:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我们把那些东西从你的脑袋里取出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Till we get those things out of your head, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.10,1:46:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,貌似你要每天都待在这了\N{\fnArial\fs30}looks like you're gonna be seeing a lot of me around here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.26,1:46:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没法救我的 公爵 没人可以 我做了太多的坏事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't save me, Duke. No one can, not after all I've done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.90,1:46:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 那不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, that wasn't you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.64,1:46:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会放弃你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not giving up on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.74,1:47:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哥们 我们看起来很帅 - 嗯 你最好习惯这种\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Man, we look good. - Yeah, well, you better get used to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.45,1:47:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,重载认为你们俩该待着永远别走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heavy Duty thinks you guys ought to stick around permanently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.32,1:47:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么是你在问我们喽？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're asking us, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.62,1:47:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是 因为他的语气不像是发问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, 'cause he didn't sound like he was asking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.82,1:47:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你一定会被邀请加入特种部队\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause you gotta be asked to join the G.I. Joes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.05,1:47:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我邀请\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm asking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.89,1:47:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.06,1:47:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你对这件事怎么看？- 我觉得我非常的感性\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do you feel about this? - I feel very emotional.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:46.23,1:47:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有特种兵集结 准备执行猫鼬行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}All Joes mobilize and ready check for Operation Mongoose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.80,1:47:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有地面运输部队在格林兄弟基地集结\N{\fnArial\fs30}All ground transports, rendezvous at Base Brothers Grimm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.17,1:47:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有咆哮猎人号在罗马废墟基地集结\N{\fnArial\fs30}All Howler Hunters will rendezvous at Base Roman Ruin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.17,1:47:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好运 特种兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck, Joes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.70,1:48:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统先生 真高兴见到您\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. President, it's good to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.87,1:48:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 还有你 - 您安全地回来真好 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. And you. - It's nice to have you back safely, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.84,1:48:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 约翰 - 欢迎回来 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. John. - Welcome back, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:35.54,1:48:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 非常感谢大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Thank you all so much.{\r}
